  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "DSH User Message Navigator",
      "text": "A Codex-style user-message navigation sidebar for DeepSeek Harness Web."
    },
    {
      "section": "Features",
      "text": "- Adds a **User messages** action to the active session header.\n- Opens as a floating right sidebar through the official `shell.overlay` slot.\n- Lists direct user prompts and admitted steering messages in conversation order.\n- Searches loaded prompts without sending their content anywhere.\n- Jumps to and briefly highlights the selected message.\n- Tracks the message nearest the current reading position.\n- Loads older history one page at a time or all remaining pages on explicit request.\n- Follows the active DSH locale and theme tokens."
    },
    {
      "section": "Features",
      "text": "Only currently visible conversation nodes are indexed. Plugin-generated context messages and compacted-away nodes are deliberately excluded."
    },
    {
      "section": "Install",
      "text": "Requires DeepSeek Harness Web `0.1.1-rc.2` or a compatible later release.\n\n```powershell\nnpx --yes @deepseek-ai/dsh plugin --profile web add \"C:\\absolute\\path\\dsh-user-message-navigator-0.1.1.tgz\"\nnpx --yes @deepseek-ai/dsh web\n```\n\nRestart DSH and refresh the browser after installation. The right-edge launcher is visible even before a session is selected; a non-empty session also shows **User messages** in its header."
    },
    {
      "section": "Development",
      "text": "```bash\nnpm install\nnpm run check\nnpm run pack:dry\n```"
    },
    {
      "section": "Privacy",
      "text": "The plugin has no host route and makes no network request. Message content remains in the active browser page and is used only for the local list, search, and navigation operations."
    },
    {
      "section": "License",
      "text": "MIT"
    },
    {
      "section": "DSH 用户消息导航",
      "text": "一个接近 Codex 使用体验的 DeepSeek Harness Web 用户消息导航侧边栏。"
    },
    {
      "section": "功能",
      "text": "- 在当前会话标题栏增加“用户消息”入口。\n- 使用当前官方版本提供的 `shell.overlay` 插槽渲染浮动右侧栏。\n- 按对话顺序列出用户直接发送的消息和运行中追加的消息。\n- 在本地搜索已加载的用户消息，不会向外发送正文。\n- 点击条目后自动切换到 Chat、滚动到对应消息并短暂高亮。\n- 滚动对话时自动标记当前阅读位置附近的用户消息。\n- 支持逐页加载更早历史，也支持用户明确点击“加载全部”。\n- 跟随 DSH 的中英文界面和明暗主题。\n\n插件只索引当前可见的会话节点。插件注入的上下文消息和已经被压缩隐藏的旧节点不会混入用户消息列表。"
    },
    {
      "section": "安装",
      "text": "要求 DeepSeek Harness Web `0.1.1-rc.2` 或兼容的后续版本。\n\n```powershell\nnpx --yes @deepseek-ai/dsh plugin --profile web add \"C:\\绝对路径\\dsh-user-message-navigator-0.1.1.tgz\"\nnpx --yes @deepseek-ai/dsh web\n```\n\n安装后重启 DSH 并刷新浏览器。即使尚未选择会话，页面右侧中部也会显示入口；打开非空会话后，标题旁还会显示“用户消息”。"
    },
    {
      "section": "使用",
      "text": "- 点击任意消息：定位并高亮原消息。\n- 输入关键词：只过滤侧边栏列表，不修改对话。\n- 按 `/`：聚焦搜索框。\n- 按 `Esc`：关闭侧边栏。\n- “加载更早消息”：只加载一页历史。\n- “加载全部”：最多连续加载 100 页；达到安全上限后仍可继续手动加载。"
    },
    {
      "section": "隐私与安全",
      "text": "插件不注册服务端路由、不读取工作区文件、不访问凭据，也不会发起网络请求。消息正文仅在当前 DSH 浏览器页面中用于列表、搜索和定位。"
    },
    {
      "section": "开发",
      "text": "```bash\nnpm install\nnpm run check\nnpm run pack:dry\n```"
    },
    {
      "section": "许可证",
      "text": "MIT"
    }
